  "xeRAbora": "",
  "RetroAchievements on a <span>real</span> PlayStation&nbsp;2.": "",
  "A patched Open PS2 Loader sends the game's memory to your PC every frame. xeRAbora checks it against the achievement set, unlocks the achievement on your RetroAchievements profile and flashes the TV gold. No emulator.": "",
