  "<b>Softcore</b>": "",
  "<b>Windows</b> / <b>Linux</b> / <b>macOS</b>, one file": "",
  "<b>Android</b>, no PC needed": "",
  "<b>No PS2 at hand?</b> The same client follows your play on any emulator with RetroAchievements. <a href=\"#nops2\">Without a PS2</a>": "",
  "The PS2 plays, the PC checks, the TV flashes.": "",
  "The PS2 sends the game's memory to xeRAbora on the PC every frame; xeRAbora sends the unlock to RetroAchievements and a notice back to the console, which flashes the TV gold.": "",
