  "Every frame of the game": "",
  "Data path during play: the EE core reads the watched addresses every frame, passes the snapshot to raudp on the IOP over SIF DMA, raudp sends UDP frames through the network driver, skipping the TCP/IP stack, to xeRAbora on the PC, which runs rcheevos and reports unlocks to retroachievements.org. The unlock notice returns to the console, which flashes the TV through the GS.": "",
